  "summary": "minetest vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that Minetest did not properly sanitize the Lua sandbox environment\nwhen using LuaJIT. A malicious mod could escape the sandbox to execute arbitrary code\nand gain full file system access on the server. An attacker could use this issue to\ncompromise the server.",
